00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:26.193 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nucléaire. Alors, il y a

00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:27.194 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une ville comme souterraine.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:28.228 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est là q d d d derniers

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:33.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
bataillons ukrainiens, qui

00:00:27.294 --> 00:00:34.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
