00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.224 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PIERRE JOLICOEUR, professeur,

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.258 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Collège militaire royal, Canada

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:59.259 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La stratégie de

00:00:57.324 --> 00:01:00.293 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Vladimir Poutine d'aujourd'hui,

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:01.528 size:53% position:73% line:53%
