00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:12.739 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le président ukrainien,

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.940 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui accueillait aujourd'hui

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:15.175 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les premiers ministres e

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:16.409 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et danois à Kiev, l'admet :

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:19.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Les forces russes contrôlent

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:19.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
