00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:09.996 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dans t-l-l-l-l-l-l-là,

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:10.997 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est la grande inconnue,

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:15.302 size:53% position:73% line:53%
